Resonator is inspired by, and derived from, Apache Wave ("Wave in a Box").
It is a complete rewrite in Rust and TypeScript: no original source file is
included, but much of the model, the operational transform, the protocols
and many tests were ported from the Apache Wave Java sources, and the test
data under crates/*/testdata was generated by running that code.

